MorphoLiquidityOptimizationTest
├── given idle cash covers the owner's accrued assets
│   ├── when exit data is unavailable
│   │   └── it skips the unused exit data and returns the owner's assets
│   ├── when idle exceeds the owner's accrued assets
│   │   └── it caps liquidity at the valued shares
│   ├── when share valuation fails
│   │   └── it still reverts
│   └── when a V1 exit adapter exists
│       └── it uses less gas than the unbounded traversal
├── given idle cash is insufficient
│   ├── when required exit data is unavailable
│   │   └── it still reverts
│   └── when the adapter wraps a nested V2 vault
│       └── it bounds nested liquidity by the nested owner and preserves nested exit gates
├── given zero shares, closed exit gates or exhausted recursion depth
│   └── it returns zero before reading unused valuation or idle cash
└── given arbitrary owner assets, idle cash and V1 adapter capacity
    └── it matches the original capacity for all nonreverting inputs

MorphoLiquidityOptimizationMainnetTest
└── given a native Morpho vault deposit with sufficient idle USDC
    └── it matches the original capacity, saves gas and successfully withdraws the returned amount
